# The macOS additions to scripts/stow-packages.
#
# Empty on purpose: the per-user launch agents are owned by nix-darwin now
# (nix/services/launchd.nix renders them into nix-darwin's
# launchd.user.agents, which writes real plists into ~/Library/LaunchAgents).
# The two com.aviral.*-auto-sync plists were the last stowed files here, and a
# stow symlink at that path would block the activation that wants to write the
# file. install.sh still loops over this list — it just reads no package.
